## THE COMMISSION
One small, test-infra change the project's board already holds as a ticket: stop an intermittent socket error in one sustainability test cell from reddening a full verify, without hiding a real failure and without touching what the cell asserts. The ticket is a bug report whose cause is unproven; the commission is the PROOF first, the fix second, and an honest PARTIAL if the proof is out of reach. The product owner's standing rules apply: merge-once-tested; a gate before every merge; CodeQL is organisational policy and is never bypassed or dismissed; a flake is never "fixed" by retrying or skipping it. You measure and build, a gate re-measures, Tuesday opens the PR, reads the runs and CodeQL, and lands.

