 5.4 **Verdict at base:** (R) REPRODUCED through the shipped path (arm S or A failed at least once with the ticket's error); (B) NOT reproduced there and only an amplifier of Step 4 reproduces it (a mechanism, not the field failure); (N) nothing reproduced anywhere (a bound only). Write it to STATUS now, before Step 6.

